@base = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health - no DB
GET {{base}}/api/learn/health

### 2. SELECT with optional search (like departmentController)
GET {{base}}/api/learn/select
###
GET {{base}}/api/learn/select?search=Cardio

### 3. INSERT - try duplicate to see 409
POST {{base}}/api/learn/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_name": "LearnTestDept",
  "description": "from learn API"
}

### 4. INSERT duplicate should 409
POST {{base}}/api/learn/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "department_name": "LearnTestDept",
  "description": "duplicate"
}

### 5. UPDATE
PUT {{base}}/api/learn/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "updated via learn API"
}

### 6. Transaction - create appointment atomically (needs patient 1, doctor 2 from your DB)
POST {{base}}/api/learn/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "doctor_id": 2
}

### 7. DELETE - will fail if doctors use it (409), else ok
DELETE {{base}}/api/learn/delete/999

### 8. Existing test-db (already in server.js)
GET {{base}}/api/test-db
### 9. Root
GET {{base}}/
